  "title": "Personalized Christian Lavender Butterfly Blanket, Lightweight",
  "handle": "personalized-christian-lavender-butterfly-blanket-lightweight",
  "body_html": "<p>Discover the perfect blend of faith, love, and comfort with this personalized Christian throw blanket from Jeminise. Designed to inspire and uplift, this blanket makes a truly unique and meaningful keepsake for Christian women, featuring inspirational messages and customizable text.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Christian Gift:</strong> A thoughtful and personalized present that combines faith, love, and comfort, ideal for Christian women.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Customization:</strong> Personalize your blanket with a custom name or text to create a one-of-a-kind meaningful item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Size Options:</strong> Available in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for versatile use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Design:</strong> Features faith-based messages and uplifting Christian themes to provide daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Occasions:</strong> An ideal gift for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or other special milestones, offering spiritual encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable Polyester with a lightweight feel for all-season comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care Instructions:</strong> Hand Wash Only to maintain the quality and design of your blanket.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
